n-item\" href=\"/lang/cs\">Čeština</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/de\">Deutsch</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/el\">Ελληνικά</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/en\">English</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/eo\">Esperanto</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/es\">Español</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/es_419\">Español (latinoamérica)</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/fa\">فارسی</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/fr\">Français</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/he\">עברית</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/hi\">हिन्दी</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/hu\">Magyar</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/id\">Indonesia</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/it\">Italiano</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/ja\">日本語</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/kn\">ಕನ್ನಡ</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/nb_NO\">Norsk bokmål (norge)</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/nl\">Nederlands</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/pl\">Polski</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/pt\">Português</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/pt_BR\">Português (brasil)</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/ru\">Русский</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/sr\">Српски</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/sv\">Svenska</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/ta\">தமிழ்</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/te\">తెలుగు</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/th\">ไทย</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/tr\">Türkçe</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/uk\">Українська</a>\n              \n                  <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/lang/zh_Hans\">中文 (简体)</a>\n              \n          </div>\n        </li>\n        \n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div class=\"container-fluid flex-shrink-0  home-container \">\n  \n<header id=\"header\" class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-5 offset-md-2\">\n    <h2>Manage your shared <br />expenses, easily</h2>\n    \n        <a href=\"/demo\" class=\"tryout btn\">\n            Try out the demo\n        </a>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4\">\n    <table class=\"additional-content\"><tr>\n      <td>\n        You're sharing a house?<br />\n        Going on holidays with friends?<br />\n        Simply sharing money with others? <br />\n        <strong>We can help!</strong>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <img class=\"shareimg\" src=\"/static/images/share.svg\" />\n      </td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"row home\">\n  <div class=\"card-deck ml-auto mr-auto\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-header\">\n        Log in to an existing project\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <form\n          id=\"authentication-form\"\n          class=\"form-horizontal\"\n          action=\"/authenticate\"\n          method=\"post\">\n          <fieldset class=\"form-group\">\n            <legend></legend>\n            \n\n    \n\n    <input id=\"csrf_token\" name=\"csrf_token\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"IjQ2YTZkYTZmOTVmNmUzYTgxMjM5NWJhYzJhMzU2ODQzMWViMjU4ZmEi.aolywg.37l61fIOdBeG_5W76cURgp53FDc\">\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"id\">Project identifier</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"id\" name=\"id\" placeholder=\"\" required type=\"text\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"password\">Private code</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"\" required type=\"password\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n\n          </fieldset>\n          <div class=\"controls\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" type=\"submit\">\n              Log in\n            </button>\n            <a\n              class=\"password-reminder btn btn-link\"\n              href=\"/password-reminder\"\n              >can't remember your password?</a\n            >\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-header\">\n        Create a new project\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        \n            <form\n            id=\"creation-form\"\n            class=\"form-horizontal\"\n            action=\"/create\"\n            method=\"post\"\n            >\n            <fieldset class=\"form-group\">\n                \n\n    \n    <input id=\"csrf_token\" name=\"csrf_token\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"IjQ2YTZkYTZmOTVmNmUzYTgxMjM5NWJhYzJhMzU2ODQzMWViMjU4ZmEi.aolywg.37l61fIOdBeG_5W76cURgp53FDc\">\n    \n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"name\">Project name</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"\" required type=\"text\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"password\">Private code</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" placeholder=\"\" required type=\"password\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"contact_email\">Email</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"contact_email\" name=\"contact_email\" placeholder=\"\" required type=\"text\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n    \n        \n          <label for=\"captcha\">Which is a real currency: Euro or Petro dollar?</label>\n        \n    \n        <div class=\"controls\">\n        \n            <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"captcha\" name=\"captcha\" placeholder=\"\" type=\"text\" value=\"\">\n        \n        \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n\n            </fieldset>\n            <div class=\"controls\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" type=\"submit\">\n                Create\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            </form>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  <footer class=\"footer mt-auto py-3\">\n      <div class=\"footer-limiter\">\n\n          <div class=\"footer-right\">\n            <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-placement=\"top\" title=\"Code\" href=\"https://github.com/spiral-project/ihatemoney\">\n              <i class=\"icon git\"><svg aria-hidden